        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "--self-test passes on the pass-2 tree: 1.339 µm, dispersion r > 0.98, predecessor stable, successor longer, GIF >= 10 frames and >= 480 px. Seed 3153. Lean is still not executed in this image, and dependencies are the repo requirements file." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
